      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 105,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "and confirmed it to Jacob for a statute; to Israel for an everlasting covenant,",
      "ko": "야곱에게 세우신 율례 곧 이스라엘에게 하신 영영한 언약이라",
      "source_text_hash": "3a895da92623623dfbd95cee615c005cd8ed66efab1b541b1ef6435b7bdf4afa",
      "translation_text_hash": "425a4b425dabb6c5ddc5a9536c91f712b5fa2373ef740e4117a689894b7ae443",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "야곱에게 세우신 율례 곧 이스라엘에게 하신 영영한 언약이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "425a4b425dabb6c5ddc5a9536c91f712b5fa2373ef740e4117a689894b7ae443"
      ]
