      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 105,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "when they were but a few men in number, yes, very few, and foreigners in it.",
      "ko": "때에 저희 인수가 적어 매우 영성하며 그 땅에 객이 되어",
      "source_text_hash": "7d6a366ed99c78ea1ef2b88c1bd683da2cb2b8ed64837c998c6f89b85f297803",
      "translation_text_hash": "7eddc0736441997c6e7e72728296c102d61a8781011fc9f32b9408730328aa00",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "때에 저희 인수가 적어 매우 영성하며 그 땅에 객이 되어"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7eddc0736441997c6e7e72728296c102d61a8781011fc9f32b9408730328aa00"
      ]
    },
